WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.420
Your customers message you at all hours,

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.540
on every channel,

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.860
and every unanswered message is a sale going cold.

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:09.360
Meanwhile,

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.900
automating support means weeks of setup,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.780
disconnected tools

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.620
and developers.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.160
GenSmart fixes that.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.160
An agentic platform to create any AI agent.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.720
It answers, qualifies and books for you,

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.920
with no code.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.240
Live in under 5 minutes.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.600
Create your agent,

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.080
load your business knowledge,

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.780
connect your channels in one click

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.060
and turn it on.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.960
And every business builds its own.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.200
A clinic that books appointments.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.260
A store that quotes and sells.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.200
A real estate agency that qualifies leads.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.580
A restaurant that manages reservations.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.230
From then on, your agent replies in seconds,

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.090
uses your business information,

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.290
qualifies the customer

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.550
and books the appointment.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.210
And when needed,

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.910
you take over the conversation.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.110
And unlike an assistant that only replies,

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.070
your agent follows a cycle with every message.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:08.370
It perceives: it reads the message and the history.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:13.890
It reasons: it understands what they want and what is holding them back.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:19.610
It plans: it decides whether to quote, book or escalate.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:24.360
It acts: it executes and logs it in your CRM.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:28.750
Every contact lands in your CRM with a score and a summary,

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.210
a visual funnel that moves on its own

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:32.090
and a calendar

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:33.410
that fills itself.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.300
And it's already live on seven channels:

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:41.840
WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, Telegram, TikTok, Web and more.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.350
One agent, every channel.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:47.300
It connects to the tools you already use,

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.300
like your HubSpot CRM or your Shopify store:

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.800
over ten thousand integrations.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.440
And if one is missing,

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:57.680
connect it through API, MCP or webhook.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:01:59.280
GenSmart.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:00.640
Build your agent.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.080
Start your free trial.

